#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:42
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of GMP"
msgstr "Instalação do GMP"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:50
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput><parameter>ABI=32</parameter> ./configure ...</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput><parameter>ABI=32</parameter> ./configure ...</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:45
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you are building for 32-bit x86, but you have a CPU which is capable of "
"running 64-bit code <emphasis>and</emphasis> you have specified "
"<envar>CFLAGS</envar> in the environment, the configure script will attempt "
"to configure for 64-bits and fail.  Avoid this by invoking the configure "
"command below with <placeholder type=\"screen\" id=\"0\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Se você estiver construindo para x86 de 32 bits, mas tem uma CPU que seja "
"capaz de executar código de 64 bits <emphasis>e</emphasis> você especificou "
"<envar>CFLAGS</envar> no ambiente, [então] o script configure tentará "
"configurar para 64 bits e falhará. Impeça isso invocando o comando do "
"configure abaixo com <placeholder type=\"screen\" id=\"0\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:54
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The default settings of GMP produce libraries optimized for the host "
"processor.  If libraries suitable for processors less capable than the "
"host's CPU are desired, generic libraries can be created by appending the "
"<option>--host=none-linux-gnu</option> option to the "
"<command>configure</command> command."
msgstr ""
"As configurações padrão do \"GMP\" produzem bibliotecas otimizadas para o "
"processador anfitrião. Se bibliotecas adequadas para processadores menos "
"capazes que a CPU do anfitrião forem desejadas, [então] bibliotecas "
"genéricas podem ser criadas anexando a opção <option>--host=none-linux-"
"gnu</option> ao comando <command>configure</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:65
#, xml-text
msgid "First, make an adjustment for compatibility with gcc-15 and later:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, faça um ajustamento para compatibilidade com gcc-15 e posteriores:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:67
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/long long t1;/,+1s/()/(...)/' "
"configure</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed -i '/long long t1;/,+1s/()/(...)/' "
"configure</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:69
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare GMP for compilation:"
msgstr "Prepare GMP para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:71
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --enable-cxx     \\\n"
"            --disable-static \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/gmp-&gmp-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --enable-cxx     \\\n"
"            --disable-static \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/gmp-&gmp-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:77
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the new configure options:"
msgstr "O significado das novas opções de configuração:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--enable-cxx</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--enable-cxx</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:82
#, xml-text
msgid "This parameter enables C++ support"
msgstr "Esse parâmetro habilita suporte a C++"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--docdir=/usr/share/doc/gmp-&gmp-version;</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--docdir=/usr/share/doc/gmp-&gmp-version;</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:89
#, xml-text
msgid "This variable specifies the correct place for the documentation."
msgstr "Essa variável especifica o lugar correto para a documentação."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile the package and generate the HTML documentation:"
msgstr "Compile o pacote e gere a documentação HTML:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:98
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"make\">make\n"
"make html</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"make\">make\n"
"make html</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><important><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The test suite for GMP in this section is considered critical.  Do not skip "
"it under any circumstances."
msgstr ""
"A suíte de teste para o GMP nesta seção é considerada crítica. Não a pule "
"sob quaisquer circunstâncias."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid "Test the results:"
msgstr "Teste os resultados:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:108
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"test\">make check 2>&amp;1 | tee gmp-check-"
"log</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"test\">make check 2>&amp;1 | tee gmp-check-"
"log</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><caution><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:110
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The code in gmp is highly optimized for the processor where it is built. "
"Occasionally, the code that detects the processor misidentifies the system "
"capabilities and there will be errors in the tests or other applications "
"using the gmp libraries with the message <computeroutput>Illegal "
"instruction</computeroutput>.  In this case, gmp should be reconfigured with"
" the option <option>--host=none-linux-gnu</option> and rebuilt."
msgstr ""
"O código em &quot;gmp&quot; é altamente otimizado para o processador onde "
"ele seja construído. Ocasionalmente, o código que detecta o processador "
"identifica erroneamente os recursos do sistema e existirão erros nos testes "
"ou em outros aplicativos usando as bibliotecas &quot;gmp&quot; com a "
"mensagem <computeroutput>Illegal instruction</computeroutput>. Nesse caso, o"
" &quot;gmp&quot; deveria ser reconfigurado com a opção "
"&quot;<option>--host=none-linux-gnu</option>&quot; e reconstruído."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Ensure that at least 199 tests in the test suite passed.  Check the results "
"by issuing the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Certifique-se de que pelo menos 199 testes na suíte de teste passaram. "
"Verifique os resultados emitindo o seguinte comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:123
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"test\">awk '/# PASS:/{total+=$3} ; END{print total}' gmp-"
"check-log</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"test\">awk '/# PASS:/{total+=$3} ; END{print total}' gmp-"
"check-log</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:125
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package and its documentation:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote e a documentação dele:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/gmp.xml:127
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">make install\n"
"make install-html</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">make install\n"
"make install-html</userinput>"

